      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DARCY MAC (6) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his outstanding win the start prior, getting around this track over 330m in 18.73. Expected to push the clock again here. ROAR OF THUNDER (3) was in winning form two back (18.80) at this track but ran below best last time at Wagga, finishing 7th. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Deserves plenty of respect. FENELLA (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 19.02 beating King Of Asgard. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Sure to be thereabouts. SIR REGGIE (2) cannot be underestimated.",
